<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia's tugrik down 0.2 pct vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Mongolia's tugrik down 0.2 pct vs dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mongolian tugrik was down 0.2124 percent against the dollar on Monday compared with the previous Monday, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The Bank of Mongolia said the tugrik had fallen to 802.02 against the U.S. currency, from 800.32 a week ago.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official rate based on previous week's interbank trade.</p>
<p>-- Ulan Bator Newsroom (9761) 312-565</p>
